							</p>

						</div>


						<div class="summary-item">

							<span>
								03
							</span>

							<p>
								The three important sides are
								perpendicular, base and hypotenuse.
							</p>

						</div>


						<div class="summary-item">

							<span>
								04
							</span>

							<p>
								The hypotenuse is always opposite
								the 90° angle.
							</p>

						</div>

					</div>


